      "conflict": false
    },
    {
      "id": "fact:survival-loop",
      "statement": "Survival gives preparation time and a supply drop, then five-minute speaker-defense waves; supply drops follow successful waves, helicopter extraction follows wave three, and early extraction opens after two failed waves.",
